# Scripts and configs run on Linux; CRLF breaks bash ("\r: command not found")
# and Lua/JSON parsers. Keep LF in the repository and in every checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.qsb binary
*.wav binary
